<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n58897" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κονῐορτ-ός</span></b> , ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόνις, ὄρνυμι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dust raised</i> or <i>stirred up, cloud of
			dust</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				8.65
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ κ. δῆλος αὐτῶν ὡς ὁμοῦ
					προσκειμένων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					245
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.44
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τῆς ὕλης νεωστὶ
			κεκαυμένης</span>, i.e. <i>a cloud</i> of woodashes, ib.<i><span class="en">
				34
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. καὶ ζάλη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					496d
				</span></i>
			: in pl., <i><span class="en">
				Diocl.Fr.
				147
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> generally,
				<i>dirt, sweepings</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σαρώματα . .
				σὺν τῷ κ.</span> Wilcken <i><span class="en">
				<u>Chr.</u>
				198.16
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph., <i>dirty fellow</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαίρει τις αὐχμῶν ἢ ῥυπῶν, κ.
					ἀναπέφηνεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Anaxandr.
					34.6
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Aristopho
				10.8
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Εὐκτήμων ὁ κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					21.103
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
